# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository.
#
# The tree had grown a mix of CRLF and LF files, so running Prettier rewrote
# whole files and buried real changes in line-ending noise. Git now detects text
# files automatically and stores them with LF regardless of the platform they
# were written on; working copies on Windows still check out as the editor
# prefers.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries Git should never touch, listed explicitly rather than relying on
# content detection.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
